></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: blueviolet\"><b>Average</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Mastermind Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mastermind_Shield_571249.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Armor\"><img alt=\"Golden Armor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Golden_Armor_6f03fe.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Demonbone Amulet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demonbone_Amulet_6db9bf.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Heavy Mace\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Heavy_Mace_a0c510.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Titan Axe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Titan_Axe_df6aac.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">11.80.7048<br/>July 3, 2018<br/>Summer Update 2018</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Falcon Bastion</b>, also known as the Falcon Castle, is the secret hideout of the Falcon Knights. Forgotten for a long time, the location and steps necessary have recently been discovered by heroes seeking information about <a href=\"#/wiki/Secret%20Library\">The Secret Library</a>.\n</p><p>The Bastion consists of the Castle, which is in ruins, and also of an underground area. The Castle is very tricky to hunt at, because it has many small rooms and cracks that send you to the floor below it. The underground area is wider and more suitable to hunting.\n</p><p>Part of <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Secret%20Library%20Quest\">The Secret Library Quest</a> takes place here and you must be level 250 or higher to enter it.\n</p><p>Many secrets are hidden inside the Falcon Bastion:\n</p>\n<ul><li>You can find the 9 volumes of The Grand Master of Verbal Debate hidden around the castle.</li>\n<li>You will find several <a href=\"#/wiki/Brass-Shod%20Chest\">Brass-Shod Chests</a> in the Bastion, which can be used once every 20? hours. From them you can get a <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Ingot\">Gold Ingot</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Ring\">Death Ring</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Roasted%20Dragon%20Wings\">Roasted Dragon Wings</a> and possibly more.</li>\n<li>You can find the Key 0909 on the upper floors and use it to unlock <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33360,31350,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">this (33360, 31350, 7)</a> and <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33368,31331,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">this (33368, 31331, 7)</a> doors on the ground floor.</li>\n<li>You can find a Can of Grease <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33364,31335,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33364, 31335, 7)</a> and use it to open the gate <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33369,31316,3\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33369, 31316, 3)</a>.</li>\n<li>You can break the wall in the basement <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33375,31343,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33375, 31343, 8)</a> to access the area to the east. In it you will find the NPC Crowned Tree. Talking to it will grant you the chance to fight the <a href=\"#/wiki/Thawing%20Dragon%20Lord\">Thawing Dragon Lord</a>.</li>\n<li>After talking to the Crowned Tree, you can use the Frozen Dragon <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33361,31315,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33361, 31315, 5)</a> to wake the <a href=\"#/wiki/Thawing%20Dragon%20Lord\">Thawing Dragon Lord</a>. If the Stone Wall (Falcon Bastion) blocks your path to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Thawing%20Dragon%20Lord\">Thawing Dragon Lord</a> simply use it to break it down.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Regular_Creatures\">Regular Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandcrawler\"><img alt=\"Sandcrawler\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sandcrawler_dcb422.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandcrawler\">Sandcrawler</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">20</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">30</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">15 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-6× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandcrawler%20Shell\">Sandcrawler Shell</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Falcon%20Paladin\"><img alt=\"Falcon Paladin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Falcon_Paladin_db9aec.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Falcon%20Paladin\">Falcon Paladin</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">6,900</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">8,500</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1200+</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-6× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Diamond\">Small Diamond</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Spirit%20Potion\">Great Spirit Potion</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Assassin%20Star\">Assassin Star</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\">Small Ruby</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Topaz\">Small Topaz</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-15× <a href=\"#/wiki/Onyx%20Arrow\">Onyx Arrow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Violet%20Gem\">Violet Gem</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Gem\">Red Gem</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Gem\">Green Gem</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Shimmering%20Pearl%20%28Green%29\">Giant Shimmering Pearl (Green)</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Damaged Armor Plates (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Falcon Crest (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Armor\">Golden Armor</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Mastermind Shield (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Falcon%20Knight\"><img alt=\"Falcon Knight\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Falcon_Knight_eed5a4.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Falcon%20Knight\">Falcon Knight</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">6,300</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">9,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1260+</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-8× <a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Soul%20Orb\">Soul Orb</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potion</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Health%20Potion\">Great Health Potion</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Assassin%20Star\">Assassin Star</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Demonic%20Blood\">Flask of Demonic Blood</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-15× <a href=\"#/wiki/Onyx%20Arrow\">Onyx Arrow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Diamond\">Small Diamond</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\">Small Ruby</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Topaz\">Small Topaz</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Shimmering%20Pearl%20%28Green%29\">Giant Shimmering Pearl (Green)</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Titan Axe (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Spiked Squelcher (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight%20Armor\">Knight Armor</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Damaged Armor Plates (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Falcon Crest (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Gem\">Green Gem</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>War Axe (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Violet%20Gem\">Violet Gem</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Armor\">Golden Armor</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Mastermind Shield (rare)</li>\n<li>D